        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xm",
          "text": "Most people expect a straightforward answer, yet the question of whether wrongful death settlements are taxable becomes more layered once federal rules ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xo",
          "text": "separate damages by purpose",
          "marks": [
            "l1xn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xp",
          "text": " rather than by case type, which is why many families still ask, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xq",
          "text": "“Are wrongful death settlements taxable?”",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xr",
          "text": " as they review how compensation gets defined.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1xu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xt",
          "text": "Some portions clearly fall outside taxation, others do not, and the difference often comes down to how the compensation gets labeled and documented in the final agreement.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1xw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xv",
          "text": "Here is where those distinctions usually show up:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b1xz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xx",
          "text": "Punitive damages:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1xy",
